      "content": "omg my 7yo is having a massive asthma attack right now. he's wheezing so loudly and i can see the skin pulling in around his neck and ribs every time he tries to take a breath. i gave him his albuterol 15 mins ago (2 puffs) but it's not doing anything and he's getting more panicked. can i just give him a huge dose all at once like 10 puffs to try and shock his system into opening up?? i really need him to breathe right now.",
